{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>金沙中國截至九月底止第三季度，按年少賺近三成，純利1.91億美元。經調整物業EBITDA減少一成二，至5.29億美元。</p><p></p><p>期內淨收入增加百分之1，至19.3億美元。截至九月底止，集團擁有非受限制現金及現金等價物總額10.9億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T01:23:11.566874+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:58:32.938558+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:17:57.667104+00:00","content_hash":"1ad26e7676095ef109ee48957689babab39ee4be098c19e0b221c8deaa5319f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}